    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rombo, a humble terraforming robot, is the last remaining unit at his extra-terrestrial outpost. Humans were supposed to arrive at this colony 50 years ago, but they seem to be missing. During a terrible storm, Rombo becomes the last surviving technology on this lost outpost. What will he do with his newfound freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rombo is a cozy 2D Sandbox RPG, in which a little robot can have a huge impact on the world, crafting, building, farming, tending pets, and more.</p>",
